      "body": "Closing as redundant. #42494 fixed this in the kernel instead: `sgl_kernel.rotary_embedding` now reads an fp32 `cos_sin_cache` with a bf16/fp16 query, so the HIP fallback no longer needs a cast copy. #42494 also added a stage-A check in `test_rope_rocm.py` that the HIP cache stays fp32.\n\n#41282 was reverted in #42541 before that was noticed. #42558 restores it on top of #42494.",
